id: handler
name: File handlers
description: Author guidance and example folders with explicit expected verdicts and feedback.
  Omit `derived/` when authoring a handler package. Add it to Capabilities, then Build
  it from its card (it opens a work stack); add the result back, then review and accept
  the build on the card.
